cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use litman in your work, please cite it as below."
title: litman
abstract: >-
  litman keeps the papers a researcher has read in plain files on their own
  computer, one folder per paper holding the PDF, a structured record, the
  notes, and the running discussion about it. The library is reachable through
  a web app for reading and annotating and through a checked command line, so
  an AI assistant can do the filing and help with the reading.
type: software
